{"t": 1794112062.796295, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix.\n\n**Root cause:** Production error `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, 2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2). The Android keyboard inserts surrounding/inner spaces and lower-cases input, and `checkout.promo.normalize_code` was a pass-through that returned the raw string, so lookups missed.\n\n**Change:** `checkout/promo.py` \u2014 `normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes all inner whitespace (including non-breaking spaces) and upper-cases the result, per the agreed product + mobile behaviour. `None` is passed through unchanged.\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'Autumn 24'`, `'autumn24'` and `'autumn\\u00a024'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
